  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Dread Mob",
    "summary": "In [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) or [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), whenever an **ORKS WALKER** unit of yours, other than a **TITANIC** unit, is **selected to attack**, for that unit you can roll a D6 or 2 D6, re-rolling any duplicate results until none remain. Each result gives the unit's attacks:\n\n- +1 A on a 1-2\n- +2 S on a 3-4\n- +1 AP on a 5-6\n\nIf you rolled 2 D6, the unit makes a [hazard roll](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls) after it has attacked.",
